stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CLOSED

    CLOSED --> OPEN: rolling error rate ≥ 50%<br/>(errorThresholdPercentage)
    OPEN --> HALF_OPEN: after 15000ms<br/>(resetTimeout)
    HALF_OPEN --> CLOSED: probe request succeeds
    HALF_OPEN --> OPEN: probe request fails

    CLOSED: CLOSED
    CLOSED: Requests hit the repository directly.
    CLOSED: Each call has a 2000ms timeout.

    OPEN: OPEN
    OPEN: Requests short-circuit immediately.
    OPEN: Fallback (stale snapshot) served instead.

    HALF_OPEN: HALF-OPEN
    HALF_OPEN: Exactly one trial request allowed through
    HALF_OPEN: to test if the downstream recovered.
